        },
        {
          "text": "Kukumana bakwesu, amutukombelele, kuti makani aa-Mwami kaaya buyakisya akuzunda koonse koonse, mbubonya mbwaakacita kulindinywe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
