        },
        {
          "text": "Eno bakwesu, twamulailila muzina lya-Mwami Jesu Kristo, kuti mumwaanzaane kufumbwa sibunyina uuenda cakupilingana akuteenda muziyanza nzomwakatambula kulindiswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.6",
